  "Chapter": "银河座　第3章",
  "Title": "银河的威信",
  "EpisodeDetail": [
    {
      "Id": 1030302001,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030302,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 1,
      "SpeakerName": "节目主持人",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "呃——。《Saint-Cloud Guide》发布异例声明，令演剧界为之震动。/n当然，日本的剧团也不可能不受影响。",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "701",
      "BgmFileName": "203",
      "VoiceFileName": "10303020010",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030302002,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030302,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 2,
      "SpeakerName": "节目评论员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "去年入选的是东部的奥林匹斯、西部的太宰府、丹波演剧团，/n以及传统名门银河座，共四个剧团。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10303020020",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030302003,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030302,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "SpeakerName": "节目评论员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "而这一次公布的评选方针要严格得多。/n一旦在这里落选，世人的看法恐怕也会改变。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10303020030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030302004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030302,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "节目主持人",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那么接下来，也来听听嘉宾的意见。/n现任丹波演剧团首席导演的——",
      "VoiceFileName": "10303020040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030302005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030302,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "真是的。明明是他们擅自送来的星，/n现在又凭自己一时兴起来夺走……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10303020050",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 72,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
